{"ID":"20240504164229-7mltw33","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504164229-7mltw33","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504164229-7mltw33\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504164538-fzslmyx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617112836-fkdxxzc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621084756-biodigo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:24\u0026#125;","title":"111橘柚（陈皮、桔柚、橘皮、桔皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903091219"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504164538-fzslmyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504164538-fzslmyx","updated":"20240504164538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产川渝地区、广东、福建、江西等地。\n【性状】\t常剥成数瓣，基部相连，有的呈不规则的片状，厚1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4mm。外表面橙红色或红棕色，有细皱纹及凹下的点状油室；内表面浅黄白色，粗糙，附黄白色或黄棕色筋络状维管束。质稍硬而脆。气香，味辛、苦。广陈皮：常3瓣相连，形状整齐，厚度均匀，约1mm。点状油室较大，对光照视，透明清晰。质较柔软。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，温。\n【功效】\t理气健脾，燥湿化痰。用于胸脘胀满，食少吐泻，咳嗽痰多。\n【注解】\t“鬃眼”：指果皮表面的油室，为紧密排列的小圆点，对光照射清晰透明。"}]},{"ID":"20240504164538-c28a5kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504164538-c28a5kv","updated":"20240504164538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094624-b3pimo8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710114813-wkobsrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710114813-wkobsrx","updated":"20240715161352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"